      "writtenOn": "2024-06-07T12:04:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, `d.installPath` is the path to the apk/jar, not the path to the dexpreopt artifacts. An apk/jar and its dexpreopt artifacts can be on different partitions. For example, an apk on `/system` can have dexpreopt artifacts on `system_other`.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/dexpreopt/dexpreopt.go;l\u003d249;drc\u003dd5137445c0d4067406cb3e38aade5507ff2fcd16",
